[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13561.75, "timestamp": "03:46:01", "text": "あ、黒っぽい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13566.63, "timestamp": "03:46:06", "text": "わあ。紺色。ユナイテッド航空は青っぽいのかな。UA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13569.51, "timestamp": "03:46:09", "text": "も青っぽい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13574.469, "timestamp": "03:46:14", "text": "ニュージーランド。いや、ジマー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13578.55, "timestamp": "03:46:18", "text": "あ、かっこいい。デザインが気に入った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13581.03, "timestamp": "03:46:21", "text": "これも黒。わあ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13604.95, "timestamp": "03:46:44", "text": "それで、パスポートってどういう仕組みなの？全然わから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13607.67, "timestamp": "03:46:47", "text": "ない。じゃあ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13609.75, "timestamp": "03:46:49", "text": "日本に旅行するとしよう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13612.389, "timestamp": "03:46:52", "text": "え？日本のパスポートを持っていくの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13615.429, "timestamp": "03:46:55", "text": "それとも 日本への入国スタンプって、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13617.269, "timestamp": "03:46:57", "text": "インドのパスポートに押されるの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13618.79, "timestamp": "03:46:58", "text": "？"}]